# Component placement

- Put design primitives in `src/design/primitives/` (and motion/icons under `src/design/`).
- Put product UI in `src/features/<feature>/components/`.
- Keep screens in each feature's `screens/` (one screen per file).
- Keep screen data/handlers in each feature's `hooks/`.
- Put pure business logic in `src/domain/`; put DB access in `src/db/repositories/`.
- Promote a feature component to `src/design/` only after real cross-feature reuse.
- Do not import another feature's private components; use that feature's public exports (`index.ts` or documented screen entry).
- Keep props narrow and typed; prefer composition over many boolean variants.
